  "_doc": "Demo system map for sysmap-to-miro. Everything here is invented. It shows the two things the skill leans on: (1) service-accurate icons inferred from each node's label/sublabel (e.g. 'DynamoDB', 'SQS queue', 'Firehose', 'Kinesis'), and (2) boundaries that become titled white zones on the Miro board. Run: node bin/ir-to-miro.mjs examples/url-shortener.architecture.json --iconset aws",
  "components": [
    { "id": "client",   "type": "external",   "label": "API client",        "sublabel": "browser · CLI · SDK",   "pos": [40, 280],  "size": [150, 60] },
